msgstr "Dif. Conservar"

#: appEditors/appGerberEditor.py:8191
msgid "Explode Regions"
msgstr "Descomponer regiones"

#: appEditors/appGerberEditor.py:8193
msgid ""
"Replace selected polygon material with explicit regions. Holes are "
"retained. Difference subtracts the other selections from the first. Keep "
"Cutters retains them. Clear records are rejected."
msgstr ""
"Reemplaza el material de polígono seleccionado por regiones explícitas. Los "
"huecos se conservan. La diferencia resta las demás selecciones de la "
"primera. Conservar formas restadas las mantiene. Se rechazan los registros "
"de polaridad clear."

#: appEditors/appGerberEditor.py:8200
msgid "Rectangle Region"
msgstr "Región rectangular"

#: appEditors/appGerberEditor.py:8201
msgid "Text Regions"
msgstr "Regiones de texto"

#: appEditors/appGerberEditor.py:8204
msgid ""
"Draw numeric material as explicit regions, retaining text holes and islands."
msgstr ""
"Dibuja material numérico como regiones explícitas, conservando los huecos e "
"islas de texto."

#: appEditors/appGerberEditor.py:8224
msgid ""
"New diameter of selected plain circular flashes. Tracks and noncircular "
"features are skipped; shared apertures are not resized."
msgstr ""
"Nuevo diámetro de los flashes circulares simples seleccionados. Se omiten "
"las pistas y los elementos no circulares; las aperturas compartidas no se "
"redimensionan."

#: appEditors/appGerberEditor.py:8229
msgid ""
"Resize selected circular flashes about their own centers, as one undo step."
msgstr ""
"Redimensiona los flashes circulares seleccionados respecto a sus propios "
"centros, como un único paso de deshacer."

