# auto-review 2026-10-21: new
#: appPlugins/ToolGcodeSender/SenderEcutIO.py:216
msgid ""
"PWM/DAC controls the spindle speed output; map SPINDLE_CW/CCW on Output "
"signals for run control. The VFD run input and analog speed input require "
"their corresponding wiring. The recovered raw PWM period is editable; "
