# auto-review 2026-10-09: corrected
#: appPlugins/ToolIsolation/IsolationUI.py:712
msgid ""
"Create a Geometry object with toolpaths to cut \n"
"isolation outside, inside or on both sides of the\n"
"object. For a Gerber object outside means outside\n"
"of the Gerber feature and inside means inside of\n"
"the Gerber feature, if possible at all. This means\n"
"that only if the Gerber feature has openings inside, they\n"
"will be isolated. If what is wanted is to cut isolation\n"
"inside the actual Gerber feature, use a negative tool\n"
"diameter above."
msgstr ""
"Cree un objeto Geometría con trayectorias para cortar el\n"
"aislamiento por fuera, por dentro o en ambos lados del\n"
"objeto. Para un objeto Gerber, fuera significa fuera\n"
"del elemento Gerber y dentro significa dentro del\n"
"elemento Gerber, si es posible. Esto significa\n"
"que solo si el elemento Gerber tiene aberturas interiores,\n"
"estas se aislarán. Si lo que se quiere es cortar el aislamiento\n"
"dentro del propio elemento Gerber, use un diámetro de\n"
"herramienta negativo arriba."

